            <li><span class="beep-key-combo" dir="ltr"><kbd>M</kbd></span><span>Cut marker at the white line</span></li>
            <li><span class="beep-key-combo" dir="ltr"><kbd>,</kbd> · <kbd>.</kbd></span><span>One frame back · forward (with a video)</span></li>
